    "body": "1. What about other types of frames, such as FRAME or OBJECT? Should they get service workers as well?\r\n2. Is it always OK to use the parent browsing context's active document's environment? https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#origin seems to imply that `about:blank` doesn't always inherit the origin of the parent browsing context's active document, so this would cause a mismatch?",
